# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agent instruction files.
#
# These stay on the developer's machine and never reach the public repo. The
# pre-commit hook and the CI job both enforce this; the entries here are the
# first line of defence, not the only one.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
.agents/
.cursor/
.worktrees/
agent-notes/
scratch/
personal/

# Secrets. Nothing in this project needs a credential to build or run, so a
# file matching these patterns is a mistake by definition.
.env
.env.*
*.local
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output.
#
# Every worktree builds into build/<task> so parallel tasks never collide on
# object files. Ignore the whole tree rather than the individual directories.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
build/
out/
CMakeUserPresets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE and editor.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party downloads.
#
# The WebView2 SDK is fetched by scripts/fetch-deps.ps1 into third_party/. It
# is redistributable but it is not ours, so it is not committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
third_party/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Windows shell noise.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
